   - Override `PreTranslateMessage` or call `SetFocus()` whenever the mouse enters so the control receives keyboard events:
     ```cpp
     BOOL CViewport::PreTranslateMessage(MSG* pMsg) {
         if (pMsg->message == WM_KEYDOWN || pMsg->message == WM_KEYUP) {
             // handle locally
             return TRUE;
         }
         return CStatic::PreTranslateMessage(pMsg);
     }
     ```

